{"id": "86268", "name": "החלפת בסיס לוגריתם – log_a(xⁿ) בעזרת ln (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Given that \\(\\ln(a)={{CT:0}}\\) , express: \\[\\log_{a}(x^{{CT:1}})\\] as a single multiple of a natural logarithm.</p>\n<p>\\(\\log_{a}(x^{{CT:1}}) = \\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>Below are the basic rules of logarithms.<br />\\[\\log_{b}(mn) = \\log_{b}(m) +\\log_{b}(n)\\]<br />\\[\\log_{b}\\left(\\frac{m}{n}\\right) = \\log_{b}(m) -\\log_{b}(n)\\]<br />\\[\\log_{b}(m^n) = n\\cdot\\log_{b}(m)\\]</p>\n<p>\\[\\log_{a}(m)=\\frac{\\log_{b}(m)}{\\log_{b}(a)}\\]</p>\n<p><br />Hence \\[\\log_{a}(x^{{CT:1}}) = {{CT:1}}\\log_{a}(x) = {{CT:1}}\\frac{\\ln(x)}{\\ln(a)}\\]</p>\n<p>\\[ = {{CT:1}}\\frac{\\ln(x)}{{CT:0}}={{CT:2}}\\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": "<p>Check the Log Laws</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": "<p>Check the Log Laws</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "correctanswer", "n", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2"], "nvariants": 50}